    <detaileddescription>
<para>In order to compute market vegas, we need a class that gives the derivative of a cap implied vol against changes in pseudo-root elements. This is that class.</para><para>The operation is non-trivial because the cap implied vol has a complicated relationship with the caplet implied vols.</para><para>This is tested in the pathwise vegas routine in MarketModels.cpp </para>    </detaileddescription>
